From f3f101bb9fdd411adcaebd93974674af91252cab Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 10:25:55 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 07/37] ZoneRebalance: the rebalance scan's body (phase 2,
 first leaves)

Adds the scan body's contract (mark scratch, then test the zoned cell:
stop on a blank, stop on a nonempty track-t slot, else skip the zone) and
its fields; generalizes the singleton adapter to zr_exitsContract, gives
zr_stepContract an optional write, and factors the loop round through
zr_round_of_body.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_0155fKrzMUhziJHzQxJacYbw
